  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of the Google Cloud KMS envelope-key provider, completing the AWS KMS / Azure Key Vault / Google Cloud KMS trio over the IContentKeyProvider seam. No change to the .pqfe v2 container format, which remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
